{"fields":[{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasIntroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"intro","n":"IntroAudio"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasPromptAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"prompt","n":"PromptAudio","s":"Quels sont les ingrédients d'un soufflé au chocolat ?"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio0"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_0_hint","n":"ClueAudio0","s":"Oh come on, it's in the name people!"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio1"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_1_hint","n":"ClueAudio1","s":"If you wanna make a souffle you gotta crack a couple of these babies."},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio2"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_2_hint","n":"ClueAudio2"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio3"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_3_hint","n":"ClueAudio3","s":"Can't believe you haven't thought of putting in a pinch of this."},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio4"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_4_hint","n":"ClueAudio4"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio5"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_5_hint","n":"ClueAudio5","s":"I'll give you a hint... it's an extract... made from vanilla."},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio6"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_6_hint","n":"ClueAudio6"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasFollowupAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"followup","n":"FollowupAudio","s":"I mean, come on, one of them is in the title."},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasOutroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"outro","n":"OutroAudio"}]}
